            <tr class="border-b border-slate-50 hover:bg-slate-50"><td class="px-4 py-2 font-medium flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-indigo-500" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 19a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h5l2 3h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/></svg>合规审查项目</td><td class="px-3 py-2"><span class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-green-50 text-green-700 text-[9px]">进行中</span></td><td class="px-3 py-2 text-slate-400">2025-04-05</td></tr>
